I go into the kitchen.
This kitchen is very small.
I open the cupboards.
The cupboards are empty.
There is nothing in the cupboards.
I have a small bag in my hand.
There is coffee from Mexico in the bag.
This is my favorite coffee.
There are also two mugs in the bag.
They are mugs from my home.
I take the coffee out.
I take out the two mugs as well.
I put them on the counter.
Now, the coffee sits on the counter.
The two mugs sit near the coffee.
There is a good smell in the kitchen now.
